  "description": "FOZGAF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H74 Gd4 N18 O26. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.830-4.329 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.08-113.06°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H74Gd4N18O26.",
